	(descr "KOGUMA MK4 main board: slot (NPTH 6.6x1.0mm) for the encoder board (0.6mm) and solder pads on the top side. Chip side = -Y (pads 1 and 7: 3V3, GND), back side = +Y (pads 2-6: CAL, MISO, MOSI, SCK, CS). Rotation 0 = chip side toward the top of the screen (left encoder of the robot); rotate 180deg for the right encoder")
